flowchart TD
Start["**Start MOO Optimization**<br/>Initialize multi objective optimization for buffer capacities"]
DefineObjectives["**Define Objectives**<br/>Set objectives: maximize throughput, minimize WIP"]
DefineDecisionVars["**Define Decision Variables**<br/>Buffers capacities as discrete integers {1-3} for<br/>PostLoadingBuffer, PostConveyorBuffer, PostWashingBuffer,<br/>PrePress1Buffer, PrePress2Buffer, PostPress12Buffer"]
DefineConstraints["**Define Constraints**<br/>Hard constraints on capacities {1-3}<br/>Simulation time and warmup fixed<br/>Model structure and routing fixed"]
SelectMOOAlgo["**Select MOO Algorithm**<br/>Choose algorithm such as NSGA II or MOEA/D<br/>Configure population size, generations, crossover, mutation"]
InitPopulation["**Initialize Population**<br/>Generate initial set of candidate capacity vectors<br/>Each individual is a tuple of 6 integer capacities {1-3}"]
LoopGen["**Generation Loop**<br/>Iterate over generations until stopping criterion met"]
EvalPop["**Evaluate Population**<br/>For each individual capacity configuration<br/>call simulation wrapper to obtain KPIs"]
CreateSimConfig["**Create Sim Config**<br/>Map individual genes to buffer capacities<br/>Build configuration object for run_simulation"]
RunSimWrapper["**Run Simulation Wrapper**<br/>Call run_simulation_with_capacities<br/>which internally calls run_simulation multiple times"]
ClassMOOController["**Class MOOController**<br/>Attributes: population, objectives, constraints,<br/>max_generations, current_generation, archive<br/>Methods: initialize_population, evaluate_population,<br/>select_parents, apply_crossover, apply_mutation,<br/>update_archive, run_optimization"]
ClassSimConfig["**Class SimulationConfig**<br/>Attributes: post_loading_cap, post_conveyor_cap,<br/>post_washing_cap, pre_press1_cap, pre_press2_cap,<br/>post_press12_cap, runs, warmup, sim_time, seed_base<br/>Methods: to_buffer_dict"]
ClassSimRunner["**Class SimulationRunner**<br/>Attributes: config<br/>Methods: run_replications, single_run,<br/>aggregate_results, compute_objectives"]
ClassIndividual["**Class Individual**<br/>Attributes: genome capacities vector length 6,<br/>objectives throughput, wip,<br/>constraints_ok, rank, crowding_distance<br/>Methods: decode_to_config, dominates"]
ClassPopulation["**Class Population**<br/>Attributes: individuals list of Individual<br/>Methods: sort_by_rank, get_pareto_fronts"]
ClassObjectiveEvaluator["**Class ObjectiveEvaluator**<br/>Attributes: weights optional, normalization_params<br/>Methods: evaluate individual, compute_penalties"]
ModifyRunSimulation["**Modify run_simulation**<br/>Refactor to accept buffer capacities as parameters<br/>and return throughput and WIP for each run"]
SetBuffersFromConfig["**Set Buffers From Config**<br/>Inside run_simulation_with_capacities<br/>instantiate DelayBuffer objects with capacities<br/>from SimulationConfig"]
CallRunSimulation["**Call run_simulation**<br/>Execute simulation for given seed and config<br/>collect throughput, WIP, energy, bottleneck data"]
AggregateKPIs["**Aggregate KPIs**<br/>Average throughput and WIP over replications<br/>compute objective vector for individual"]
AssignObjectives["**Assign Objectives to Individual**<br/>Set individual.throughput and individual.wip<br/>mark constraints_ok if capacities in {1-3}"]
CheckConstraints["**Check Constraints**<br/>Verify all capacities within {1-3}<br/>discard or penalize infeasible individuals"]
NonDomSort["**Non dominated Sorting**<br/>Sort individuals into Pareto fronts<br/>based on throughput and WIP"]
CrowdingCalc["**Crowding Distance**<br/>Compute crowding distance within each front<br/>for diversity preservation"]
SelectParents["**Select Parents**<br/>Use tournament selection based on rank<br/>and crowding distance"]
Crossover["**Crossover Operator**<br/>Combine parent genomes to create offspring<br/>ensure integer capacities and bounds {1-3}"]
Mutation["**Mutation Operator**<br/>Randomly change capacity genes by plus or minus 1<br/>clip to {1-3}"]
CreateOffspringPop["**Create Offspring Population**<br/>Build new set of candidate individuals<br/>from crossover and mutation results"]
MergePopulations["**Merge Populations**<br/>Combine parent and offspring populations<br/>for next non dominated sorting"]
UpdateArchive["**Update Pareto Archive**<br/>Store non dominated solutions across generations<br/>for final output"]
CheckStop["**Check Stopping Criterion**<br/>If max_generations reached or convergence detected<br/>terminate optimization loop"]
ExtractParetoSet["**Extract Pareto Set**<br/>Collect final non dominated individuals<br/>with their capacity vectors and KPIs"]
SelectPreferredSolution["**Select Preferred Solution**<br/>Optionally apply decision maker preferences<br/>choose one configuration from Pareto set"]
ExportBestConfig["**Export Best Configuration**<br/>Save selected buffer capacities to file or database<br/>for use in production or further analysis"]
UseConfigInMain["**Use Config in Main Simulation**<br/>Replace hard coded capacities in main block<br/>with optimized capacities from MOO results"]
End["**End Optimization**<br/>Return Pareto front and selected configuration<br/>ready for deployment in production model"]

Start --> DefineObjectives
DefineObjectives --> DefineDecisionVars
DefineDecisionVars --> DefineConstraints
DefineConstraints --> SelectMOOAlgo
SelectMOOAlgo --> ClassMOOController
ClassMOOController --> InitPopulation
InitPopulation --> ClassIndividual
InitPopulation --> ClassPopulation
InitPopulation --> LoopGen
LoopGen --> EvalPop
EvalPop --> CreateSimConfig
CreateSimConfig --> ClassSimConfig
CreateSimConfig --> RunSimWrapper
RunSimWrapper --> ClassSimRunner
RunSimWrapper --> ModifyRunSimulation
ModifyRunSimulation --> SetBuffersFromConfig
SetBuffersFromConfig --> CallRunSimulation
CallRunSimulation --> AggregateKPIs
AggregateKPIs --> AssignObjectives
AssignObjectives --> CheckConstraints
CheckConstraints --> ClassObjectiveEvaluator
CheckConstraints --> NonDomSort
NonDomSort --> CrowdingCalc
CrowdingCalc --> SelectParents
SelectParents --> Crossover
Crossover --> Mutation
Mutation --> CreateOffspringPop
CreateOffspringPop --> MergePopulations
MergePopulations --> UpdateArchive
UpdateArchive --> CheckStop
CheckStop -->|continue| LoopGen
CheckStop -->|stop| ExtractParetoSet
ExtractParetoSet --> SelectPreferredSolution
SelectPreferredSolution --> ExportBestConfig
ExportBestConfig --> UseConfigInMain
UseConfigInMain --> End
UpdateArchive --> ClassPopulation
UpdateArchive --> ClassIndividual